     3011   define output parameter v-prc-min as decimal   no-undo .
     3012     do
     3013     on error undo, return error return-value
     3014     :
     3015   find first ub.contract-specif-attr no-lock  where
     3016              ub.contract-specif-attr.contract-num = p-contract-num  and
     3017              ub.contract-specif-attr.host-code    = p-host-code     and
     3018              ub.contract-specif-attr.gds-code     = p-gds-code      and
     3019              ub.contract-specif-attr.attr-code    = 'prc-min':U
     3020              no-error .
